{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>警員朱振國在2005年執勤期間，遭一名青年割傷頸部而慘成植物人。他躺臥病床21年後，於2026年9月16日因器官衰竭離世，終年52歲。警務處今日（23日）為朱振國舉行最高榮譽喪禮。靈車中午12時許抵達浩園，蓋上區旗的靈柩在樂聲與同袍護送下進場，現場全場肅立默哀兩分鐘，家屬難掩傷感，一度拭淚。其後警務處處長周一鳴與一眾同袍輪流上香拜祭，送別朱振國最後一程。</p><figure><img alt=\"家屬難掩傷感，一度拭淚。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190307803747586048105847.jpeg/PoWELpSW-_Y_ERy7Y_B3ELxIkVrEGzsdFP7FWjH-xVo\"/><figcaption>家屬難掩傷感，一度拭淚。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"家屬上香拜祭。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190307269288398848837019.jpeg/-OasWKcR4anAxrRRhNCz8CaLVotMW4npyTWAFuw1gBY\"/><figcaption>家屬上香拜祭。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"家屬上香拜祭。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190307273294090240802547.jpeg/7R1rrD6NG2kpOrT2qMRAK4lOuSl9AXCMilLSh69S0oc\"/><figcaption>家屬上香拜祭。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警務處處長周一鳴與家屬握手。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190307277073289216391704.jpeg/pNlJ75XShEzLYbiaGlDrMBBFOzNW3b_S97SAgdK0gIE\"/><figcaption>警務處處長周一鳴與家屬握手。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警隊將區旗等物品交予家屬。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190307284463915008532940.jpeg/A5ys7aNsDjJWLbNOh9Lw6l_jdwtp-BoVgTBUGKQwVBg\"/><figcaption>警隊將區旗等物品交予家屬。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"場面哀傷。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190307275437379584510672.jpeg/0MGlP2ejBC3e5ZfdmWPGfpPdmqApn1hHB6So0SKkqNE\"/><figcaption>場面哀傷。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"仵工將靈柩放進墓穴。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190307282626678784904268.jpeg/Arxr_5qvUa94ytDKo9tTu5-V68rzgtD3TZ5hO2ieYTs\"/><figcaption>仵工將靈柩放進墓穴。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"家屬傷心拭淚。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190307286170996736403176.jpeg/ujDaeI-SNydXLq4Ushc-X2b4_ZYqYA0OP6Va7xqlWu8\"/><figcaption>家屬傷心拭淚。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"家屬傷心拭淚。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190307277811224576071548.jpeg/8YWUpsNPSnEXk2L8rl8cXDSInuHG2wQd9nyaQ9N8mkM\"/><figcaption>家屬傷心拭淚。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"扶靈隊伍護送靈柩進場。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190307281510731776154839.jpeg/9dDg1vDZIrfr4wSLjDveL-jM7iH6yRdiLbxsBQi8bAU\"/><figcaption>扶靈隊伍護送靈柩進場。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"扶靈隊伍護送靈柩進場。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190307285323485184169208.jpeg/4kDi5hbn68z33RTQreZdMNiB1_dD0JYBhMseKaHLHik\"/><figcaption>扶靈隊伍護送靈柩進場。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靈柩蓋上區旗。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190307288825860096298504.jpeg/-vfYNNGkY_FfhNapjcKzJvLs7n9zxk9qOgRLeh8ES3o\"/><figcaption>靈柩蓋上區旗。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靈車抵達浩園。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190307292361789440609235.jpeg/Nw0lHmJOkrDP_FXvylJXwGamp0xijBsguqTfp5-k36c\"/><figcaption>靈車抵達浩園。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190307231497719808042617.jpeg/nthxSOuKW7uB0lalBxwWnFH1AbXsaX7qZryyq0O8sqs\"/><figure><img alt=\"仵工隨後將靈柩放進墓穴。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190288871397527552827193.png/e-9_eU7wlpDOc_Bg_4KcYIrtWboOT3WTjlt2xI5bdsQ\"/><figcaption>仵工隨後將靈柩放進墓穴。</figcaption></figure><p>中午12時50分，靈車抵達和合石墳場內的「浩園」，準備進行安葬儀式。蓋上香港特別行政區區旗的靈柩從靈車抬下來，銀樂隊隨即奏響哀樂。在樂聲伴奏下，扶靈隊伍護送靈柩進場，家屬手捧朱振國遺照緊隨其後。</p><p>儀式開始時，旗手率先上前收起靈柩上的區旗。在銀樂隊奏樂下，同袍向靈柩致敬；隨後全場肅立默哀兩分鐘，期間家屬難掩悲痛拭淚。隨後，靈柩由仵工放入墓穴，警員在墓前獻上花圈。隨著警隊喪禮儀式告一段落，警務處處長周一鳴再次向家屬握手慰問，並與一眾警隊同袍輪流在墓前上香拜祭。</p><figure><img alt=\"警隊同袍輪流在墓前上香拜祭。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190291775919493120241308.png/Sia2rScZB_zUYsOdv2nPVJ_Lo1syZg-0QhXvfUIV730\"/><figcaption>警隊同袍輪流在墓前上香拜祭。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"周一鳴與其他警隊同袍輪流在墓前上香拜祭。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190290888933249024079524.png/uudV16hFmgzrltiBDJkpMOxUW--PYygUZrNwxWazcMU\"/><figcaption>周一鳴與其他警隊同袍輪流在墓前上香拜祭。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"仵工將靈柩放進墓穴，隨後警員在墓前致送花圈。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190289261660737536139806.png/Pg107SEw5jMMAwnXVfVgiwcfkes6c7pElmm9zJZpvcw\"/><figcaption>仵工將靈柩放進墓穴，隨後警員在墓前致送花圈。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:22.225170+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":690,"images":18,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:04:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:46.746907+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:40.730082+00:00","content_hash":"4bad4be285186253c8abc5c4e70c961c1a7b7ef63ed98150d07e002c3a8ff775","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}